{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50881","headline":"寻鸟窠蹟 · 魏璞","name":"寻鸟窠蹟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（原注：唐道林禅师入秦望山，见长松蟠曲如盖，送栖止其上，故称鸟窠禅师。\n）爲访名僧蹟，言寻小曲阿。\n松林春日静，石迳晚云多。\n道法传驯鹊，（原注：有鹊巢侧，自然驯狎。\n）禅机显化螺。\n（原注：尝入市，见食螺已截尾，乞放之池。\n至今螺蛳繁生。）\n悉无尾如截，遗蹟在芦院。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏璞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50881.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50881","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}